  "title": "BGP ORIGIN attribute manipulation and its impact on the Internet",
  "summary": "By doing in-depth testing, we found nearly 70% of BGP paths experience ORIGIN attribute rewrites by transit providers seeking traffic advantages. We examine the global impact of this practice and argue for deprecating ORIGIN in route selection.",
